{
    "word": "dieted",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "1112a02c-696b-329f-823d-9860d5bbc4fd",
                "word": "dieted",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "defee2fe-e496-47e8-ba6e-6da0bfd91bbd",
                        "entry_id": "1112a02c-696b-329f-823d-9860d5bbc4fd",
                        "tags": [
                            "comparative"
                        ],
                        "form": "more dieted"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "553757db-201f-47ab-b8e4-ced913b82367",
                        "entry_id": "1112a02c-696b-329f-823d-9860d5bbc4fd",
                        "tags": [
                            "superlative"
                        ],
                        "form": "most dieted"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "fbb5bced-210d-3085-a817-1f23809f1173",
                        "entry_id": "1112a02c-696b-329f-823d-9860d5bbc4fd",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Having been on a specialized diet that limits caloric intake."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "aaaefdb3-52b8-4eaa-8e1b-e742f7e5ab6c",
                                "sense_id": "fbb5bced-210d-3085-a817-1f23809f1173",
                                "text": "he's a fat, corpulent, Vnwieldy fellow; you, a dieted Sparke, Fit for the Combat."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b13975ea-b994-4e42-a83d-60d4df6dc16a",
                                "sense_id": "fbb5bced-210d-3085-a817-1f23809f1173",
                                "text": "Dr. Schmitz (Neuenahr) calls attention to four interesting cases (two fatal) as illustrating the pathogeny of diabetes, the symptoms resembling that produced in the dieted diabetics by that over-indulgence in saccharine food, for which they have such a craving."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0a4491a3-ff5c-4bd3-8f4f-a02a031e8c11",
                                "sense_id": "fbb5bced-210d-3085-a817-1f23809f1173",
                                "text": "Succulent and sweet are the dainties of the East, and even the most blasee and battered of debs and the most dieted of dowagers will find something to make their eyes sparkle and their mouths water if you make your next party an Eastern one."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e04670a1-f9fd-4250-b6be-f6b05833df05",
                                "sense_id": "fbb5bced-210d-3085-a817-1f23809f1173",
                                "text": "The thankfully preserved sinker sketch of Having Wonderful Time. with a dieted thin Skelton, is a more streamlined look at the routine."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e26eea86-7185-4a51-a6a3-b30dc11d30c5",
                                "sense_id": "fbb5bced-210d-3085-a817-1f23809f1173",
                                "text": "The dieted body can lower metabolic rate up to 40 %,"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bd65739b-8f1f-35fa-85da-4c8ee9278631",
                        "entry_id": "1112a02c-696b-329f-823d-9860d5bbc4fd",
                        "glosses": [
                            "well-fed; having or requiring extra nutrition."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "477e85f6-dbb0-45ff-91a8-3a343362ea91",
                                "sense_id": "bd65739b-8f1f-35fa-85da-4c8ee9278631",
                                "text": "The wenches swear, he kisses like a giant still; And will ride his heats as cleanly as a dieted Gelding."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "05955aa0-19c0-48d8-a8ce-c1309cf531dc",
                                "sense_id": "bd65739b-8f1f-35fa-85da-4c8ee9278631",
                                "text": "Then I say ye are a dieted horse for heaven."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7ebf9017-b035-4977-8a5c-4c201ee92042",
                                "sense_id": "bd65739b-8f1f-35fa-85da-4c8ee9278631",
                                "text": "It is, however, a dieted grass, and must be treated as such, if you desire to cultivate it to reach perfection."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4f1bc873-baec-4598-bf37-9ae2442bcdb7",
                                "sense_id": "bd65739b-8f1f-35fa-85da-4c8ee9278631",
                                "text": "Young rats fed on husked rice, refined casein, yeast, and 3 per cent. of butter from milk taken from a normally fed cow increased weight by 15 gm. in one month; whilst those fed in the same manner, but with 3 per cent. of butter from the milk of a dieted cow, increased in weight by 35 gm. in one month."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "237f11b4-edcf-3749-b59c-ca8a93c99270",
                        "entry_id": "1112a02c-696b-329f-823d-9860d5bbc4fd",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Showing the effects of dieting; resulting from limited caloric intake."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "bb604249-e116-4818-98ae-ff509791c2c4",
                                "sense_id": "237f11b4-edcf-3749-b59c-ca8a93c99270",
                                "text": "Her long slim back was straight and paltry in the modern fashion, a dieted back ."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1cd9ea71-bd84-4deb-87be-50665f24482f",
                                "sense_id": "237f11b4-edcf-3749-b59c-ca8a93c99270",
                                "text": "Josepha decided that there was a lean look about her figure, a dieted slenderness rather than the natural delicacy of youth."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "04a9fa3f-8076-4f76-ac0e-14e46d312d8b",
                                "sense_id": "237f11b4-edcf-3749-b59c-ca8a93c99270",
                                "text": "And she was so heartbreakingly frail, so courageous and mocking or courageous and earnest; the pallor wasn't all make-up, and from what her grandfather had said to him, the thinness of the arm his own arm closed on, wasn't all a dieted thinness."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5fcad3c4-da3b-4918-8896-c305d5e5796c",
                                "sense_id": "237f11b4-edcf-3749-b59c-ca8a93c99270",
                                "text": "It's natural if you are coming out of a dieted state to see a rapid surge in appetite as you begin refeeding."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "948fdd46-dcc5-4918-99d2-7f30939781c9",
                                "sense_id": "237f11b4-edcf-3749-b59c-ca8a93c99270",
                                "text": "The ideal was \"a hard, lean body, a dieted or trained one, an upright, shoulders back, unrelaxed posture, tight rather than loose movement, tidiness in domestic arrangement and eating manners, privacy in relation to bowels, abstinence or at any rate planning in relation to appetites."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0f6042a8-9e41-42e4-abd2-6e0d494f6154",
                                "sense_id": "237f11b4-edcf-3749-b59c-ca8a93c99270",
                                "text": "Her hair was tight permed and blonde and her black plastic belt broad and close around a dieted waist."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b9500cc9-89bd-3f41-9c1f-96e7d440a0ac",
                        "entry_id": "1112a02c-696b-329f-823d-9860d5bbc4fd",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Resulting from scarcity."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "bab7ed2c-b528-40cc-86d9-7c648b269281",
                                "sense_id": "b9500cc9-89bd-3f41-9c1f-96e7d440a0ac",
                                "text": "Obviously this sorded power of dull, \"lust-dieted\" appetite has not very much in common with Milton's blithe , caressing personification of pleasure, so fatal because outwardly so beautiful; though I do not doubt that Milton knew Ben Johson's Masque."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "efc8bba8-d77d-4da2-a562-63b79390f8a2",
                                "sense_id": "b9500cc9-89bd-3f41-9c1f-96e7d440a0ac",
                                "text": "The levee was social jambalaya, but it was also novelty. It proved appetizing enough to tickle the dieted palate of Richmond's exclusiveness."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cd3ec6d9-5b1e-420e-9ae6-4c982b809c3a",
                                "sense_id": "b9500cc9-89bd-3f41-9c1f-96e7d440a0ac",
                                "text": "The miles of half-empy ^([sic]) shelves that will call for new goods when prices do begin to rise; the whirring wheels of factories set spinning frantically to supply the mammoth maw of a dieted demand;"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d8dbc318-9eb9-3397-8e8f-9fecde0d8f33",
                        "entry_id": "1112a02c-696b-329f-823d-9860d5bbc4fd",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Abbreviated; reduced."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "29f6aad9-5c3b-4bd6-ad5f-2c2fb467c3f4",
                                "sense_id": "d8dbc318-9eb9-3397-8e8f-9fecde0d8f33",
                                "text": "why not diet our furniture to fit the dieted homes we were living in?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f16ce22e-bfd6-4d1a-9fbb-28567206ca27",
                                "sense_id": "d8dbc318-9eb9-3397-8e8f-9fecde0d8f33",
                                "text": "There was a long note on it in The Month for February, 1939, but in case you haven't that or some better source of information at hand, we might have a dieted version now."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fcb0fc46-56dc-4fa2-8937-ca42316ae36c",
                                "sense_id": "d8dbc318-9eb9-3397-8e8f-9fecde0d8f33",
                                "text": "It is in a booklet under the English title, \"Outline of Buddhism in Central Asia\" (Moscow, 1968-Central Department of Oriental Literature), being the dieted paper presented to the International Conference on the History , Archaeology and Culture of Central Asia in the Kushan Period ."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d1129a3f-095c-4e25-b67f-eb25b133cf89",
                                "sense_id": "d8dbc318-9eb9-3397-8e8f-9fecde0d8f33",
                                "text": "Furthermore, a round table discussions which will invited 4-6 experts will be transcribed and summarized for inclusion in the dieted volume as well."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d4a753b1-c60e-494c-9f9c-31a14f958b09",
                                "sense_id": "d8dbc318-9eb9-3397-8e8f-9fecde0d8f33",
                                "text": "In concert with the Senior Commissariat Officer and Deputy Assistant Commissary-General Robinson, immediate steps were taken to organise a dieted field hospital."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7c1425e1-04e7-3710-8f10-9bfbe84357f8",
                        "entry_id": "1112a02c-696b-329f-823d-9860d5bbc4fd",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Providing specialized dietary services, especially when addressing nutrition as an aspect of treatment."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "79da62e9-32d6-4ec4-af38-30076674c7db",
                                "sense_id": "7c1425e1-04e7-3710-8f10-9bfbe84357f8",
                                "text": "The hospital at Korti (No. 1 field-hospital) was made a dieted one on February 1st, the diets sanctioned being low, milk, chicken, roast, and entire."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "181131b0-ef0c-444e-9e0b-b49e8aad59e8",
                                "sense_id": "7c1425e1-04e7-3710-8f10-9bfbe84357f8",
                                "text": "The British station hospital is, of course, a dieted institution and is otherwise self-contained."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
